# Copy to .env and fill in, or export directly in your shell before running
# scripts/geocode_venues.py.

# Public `pk.` Mapbox token - the same one already live in triviawriterscoop.com's
# client-side geo-utils.js (visible in that site's page source to anyone,
# so not a secret) - kept as an env var here purely so it's not committed
# as a literal string, which trips GitHub's generic push-protection scanner.
MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=
